# Everything here is ignored unless it is named below, so a saved plan under any
# file name (tofu plan -out=anything), a state file or a crash log can never be
# committed by accident. Do not save plans in this folder.
*
!.gitignore
!.terraform.lock.hcl
!desired-state.json
!main.tf
!provider-fields.json
!variables.tf
!versions.tf
